<title>JAPAN: Sansui Electric to name new president.</title>
<headline>Sansui Electric to name new president.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sansui Electric Co Ltd said on Friday that its managing director Hiromi Yamato would replace current president Toshio Tamaki on March 28.  </p>
<p>Sansui did not immediately elaborate further.</p>
<p>The audio equipment maker is 60.5 percent owned by foreign investors.</p>
</text>
